{"id":"428dd837-61c9-5984-b3a5-0f577b6db22a","title":"架构","icon":"🏗️","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"架构","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"源码结构与数据流","title":"四个入口，共用一套 Core","lead":"桌面 App、本地浏览器、CLI 和 MCP 四个入口共用一套 TypeScript Core，读写同一个本机内容库。这里说明各部分在哪、数据怎样流动。","facts":[{"label":"入口","value":"桌面 · 浏览器 · CLI · MCP"},{"label":"事实来源","value":"本机内容库"},{"label":"页面模型","value":"格式版本 3"},{"label":"运行要求","value":"Node.js 22.12+"}],"art":"dev"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-bcc8e527"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-bbc8e394"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一张图看懂数据流"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"人通过工作台编辑，Agent 通过 CLI 或 MCP 编辑；两条路径在 Core 汇合，Core 是唯一读写内容库的地方。点选节点查看它在源码中的位置。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bec8e84d"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-diagram","version":"1.0.0","props":{"nodes":[{"id":"human","label":"用户","col":0,"row":0,"tone":"slate","icon":"🧑","detail":"在桌面 App 或浏览器中阅读、编辑页面。"},{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"Codex 等","col":0,"row":2,"tone":"slate","icon":"🤖","detail":"通过 ShowAI 插件的 MCP 工具操作页面；脚本和运维场景直接调用 CLI。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts"},{"id":"desktop","label":"桌面 App","sub":"Electron + React","col":1,"row":0,"tone":"brand","detail":"主进程在 `src/desktop/main.ts`，界面在 `src/studio`。窗口配置保存在系统应用数据目录，页面内容保存在所选内容库。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/install"},{"id":"browser","label":"浏览器工作台","sub":"showai serve","col":1,"row":1,"tone":"brand","detail":"`src/browser/server.ts` 只监听 `127.0.0.1`，用 HTTP 承接工作台操作，用 SSE 推送文件变化。浏览器桥接层把原有的工作台调用转成 HTTP 请求。"},{"id":"cli","label":"CLI","sub":"按需运行","col":1,"row":2,"tone":"teal","detail":"`src/agent/cli.ts`，发行包中为 `scripts/cli.mjs`。不依赖常驻服务或打开的窗口。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"},{"id":"mcp","label":"MCP","sub":"stdio · HTTP","col":1,"row":3,"tone":"teal","detail":"`src/agent/mcp.ts`（项目连接）、`mcp-library.ts`（内容库连接）、`mcp-http.ts`（HTTP 服务）。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/cli"},{"id":"actions","label":"共享工作台操作","sub":"桌面与浏览器共用","col":2,"row":0,"tone":"violet","detail":"`src/workbench/actions.ts`：Electron 与本地浏览器服务调用同一份实现，所以两种工作台的行为一致。"},{"id":"service","label":"Agent 服务","sub":"CLI 与 MCP 共用","col":2,"row":2,"tone":"violet","detail":"`src/agent/service.ts` 中 CLI 与 MCP 共用的 `AgentService`：项目解析、页面读写、目录查询、模板、导出、冲突恢复。"},{"id":"core","label":"Core","sub":"TypeScript","col":3,"row":1,"tone":"warm","detail":"存储（`store.ts`）、语义 diff（`diff.ts`）、组件与模板目录（`catalog.ts`）、三方合并（`catalog-merge.ts`）、发布校验（`publication.ts`）。"},{"id":"library","label":"内容库","sub":"~/.showai","col":4,"row":1,"tone":"warm","detail":"默认在用户主目录下的 `.showai`，可用 App 设置、`SHOWAI_HOME` 或 CLI 的 `--home` 指定。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"},{"id":"export","label":"导出器","sub":"HTML · 网站","col":4,"row":3,"tone":"rose","detail":"`src/agent/exporter.ts` 与阅读器 `src/portable`。导出时才收集页面用到的组件运行代码。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"},{"id":"server","label":"项目服务器","sub":"可选","col":4,"row":0,"tone":"slate","detail":"独立的共享 HTTP 服务，支持 Cloudflare Workers/D1/R2 与 Linux Node.js/SQLite/磁盘。本机工作台与 CLI 仍使用本地内容库。","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/project-server"}],"edges":[{"from":"human","to":"desktop"},{"from":"human","to":"browser"},{"from":"agent","to":"cli"},{"from":"agent","to":"mcp"},{"from":"desktop","to":"actions","label":"IPC"},{"from":"browser","to":"actions","label":"回环 HTTP"},{"from":"cli","to":"service"},{"from":"mcp","to":"service"},{"from":"actions","to":"core"},{"from":"service","to":"core"},{"from":"core","to":"library","label":"受控写入"},{"from":"library","to":"export"},{"from":"library","to":"server","label":"按项目同步","dashed":true,"both":true}],"groups":[{"label":"入口","from":[1,0],"to":[1,3],"tone":"brand"},{"label":"共享实现","from":[2,0],"to":[3,2],"tone":"violet"}],"initial":"core","caption":"Agent 操作不依赖桌面窗口或常驻服务；编辑器和独立阅读器使用同一份页面结构。"},"integrity":"sha256-9ceb1b83b7337bd71c87cce10635d090629d4226ec970470ceee8ab26cee0038"},"id":"node-bdc8e6ba"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-b8c8dedb"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"分层：从入口到文件"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"修改某个行为前，先找到它所在的层。点选模块查看职责和源码路径。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b7c8dd48"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-layers","version":"1.0.0","props":{"layers":[{"name":"入口","sub":"启动方式不同，能力相同","tone":"brand","modules":[{"name":"桌面 App","path":"src/desktop/main.ts","detail":"Electron 主进程、预加载桥接、关窗前等待保存。"},{"name":"本地浏览器服务","path":"src/browser/server.ts","detail":"回环 HTTP 接口与 SSE 文件变化推送；`showai serve` 启动它。"},{"name":"CLI","path":"src/agent/cli.ts","detail":"一条命令执行一次；`--json` 输出 `{ok, data}`。"},{"name":"MCP","path":"src/agent/mcp.ts","detail":"stdio 项目连接与内容库连接；`mcp-http.ts` 提供带授权的 HTTP 连接。"},{"name":"内置 Agent","path":"src/agent-host","detail":"在工作台内运行的 Agent 会话，获得绑定到项目的 MCP。"}]},{"name":"界面与编辑","sub":"React 界面","tone":"violet","modules":[{"name":"工作台界面","path":"src/studio","detail":"侧栏、标签页、设置、组件与模板目录、冲突处理对话框。"},{"name":"容器运行时","path":"src/surface/ContainerRuntime.tsx","detail":"管理展开路径、输入焦点、模块设置和通用动作。"},{"name":"递归呈现","path":"src/surface/SurfaceContent.tsx","detail":"递归呈现 Page 与 Board；Page 用正常 DOM 滚动，Board 复用 `PageSurface` 与 `useSurfaceViewport`。"},{"name":"编辑历史","path":"src/surface/SurfaceEditor.tsx","detail":"共享内容历史；阅读器使用相同的容器布局和导航。"},{"name":"富文本编辑器","path":"src/editor","detail":"基于 Tiptap 的区块编辑、表格、选择工具栏。"}]},{"name":"服务与 Core","sub":"所有写入都经过这里","tone":"warm","modules":[{"name":"Agent 服务","path":"src/agent/service.ts","detail":"CLI 与 MCP 共用的操作集合。"},{"name":"存储","path":"src/core/store.ts","detail":"页面读写、hash 与 revision 检查、锁和原子替换。"},{"name":"语义 diff","path":"src/core/diff.ts","detail":"按区块 id 返回新增、删除、移动和字段变化，也负责执行区块操作。"},{"name":"容器模型","path":"src/surface/containers.mjs","detail":"旧格式适配、容器创建与包裹、引用维护、模板插入。"},{"name":"目录","path":"src/core/catalog.ts","detail":"组件与模板的版本、作用域解析、依赖闭包、模板展开、组件编译。"},{"name":"发布","path":"src/core/publication.ts","detail":"准备发布文件、按网址校验、保存校验记录。"}]},{"name":"存储与同步","sub":"可备份、可重建","tone":"teal","modules":[{"name":"内容数据库","path":"history/content.sqlite","detail":"当前内容的权威来源。保存时原子更新内容对象、文件引用和并发令牌。"},{"name":"可读工作区","path":"workspace/projects/","detail":"由数据库生成的可读 JSON 文件：`project.json`、`pages/`、`packages/`。"},{"name":"搜索索引","path":"src/core/library-index.ts","detail":"可重建的派生索引，查询在独立工作线程中执行。"},{"name":"同步","path":"src/sync","detail":"按项目传输当前页面、依赖和资源，与项目服务器交换。"}]},{"name":"阅读器与导出","sub":"离线可读","tone":"rose","modules":[{"name":"独立阅读器","path":"src/portable","detail":"与编辑器同构的只读呈现，校验、容量与内联模式。"},{"name":"导出器","path":"src/agent/exporter.ts","detail":"单 HTML、会话片段（inline）和静态网站目录。"},{"name":"CDN 阅读器","path":"scripts/build-cdn-reader.mjs","detail":"`npm run build:cdn` 生成按需加载的阅读器包 `showai-reader`。"}]}],"initial":"存储","caption":"上层只调用下层；工作台与 Agent 的写入最终都落在同一个 Core 存储事务里。"},"integrity":"sha256-b59acf80b60aaa9d537e94db2c001d1254f5a95f699a9595793630f2494d04fe"},"id":"node-bac8e201"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-b9c8e06e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"内容存在哪里"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"默认内容库是用户主目录下的 "},{"type":"text","text":".showai","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。当前格式以 "},{"type":"text","text":"history/content.sqlite","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 为权威来源，"},{"type":"text","text":"workspace/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 下是供人和工具阅读的 JSON 投影，"},{"type":"text","text":"local/","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 下是可重建的缓存和操作记录。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-b4c8d88f"}},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"text","id":"node-b3c8d6fc"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".showai/\n  library.json                 # 内容库格式与存储类型\n  history/content.sqlite       # 当前内容（权威）\n  workspace/projects/<项目 id>/\n    project.json               # 项目元数据、文件夹层级\n    pages/<页面 id>.json     # 页面源文件（格式版本 3）\n    packages/components/<组件 id>/<版本>/\n  local/                       # 回执、事务、缓存（可重建）"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"文件夹是 "},{"type":"text","text":"project.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 里的层级元数据，页面通过 "},{"type":"text","text":"parentId","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 指向所属文件夹；删除通过 "},{"type":"text","text":"archived","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 隐藏内容。页面只保存组件的"},{"type":"text","text":"精确版本引用","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"和属性，编译好的组件放在独立的包目录。存储细节见"},{"type":"text","text":"内容库与版本","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-413e5b2c"}},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"icon":"🔒","tone":"sand","id":"node-423e5cbf"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"目录归属不是操作系统权限隔离。项目记录宿主目录的真实路径，同一目录下的多个 Agent 会话共用一个项目。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ccd04b80"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-433e5e52"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page 与 Board 容器"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"格式版本 3 把 Page 和 Board 统一成可递归嵌套的 "},{"type":"text","text":"surface","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 节点，由 "},{"type":"text","text":"attrs.kind","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 决定行为：Page 按内容顺序纵向阅读，Board 使用本地坐标、平移、缩放和绘画。父级外框保存在 "},{"type":"text","text":"layout","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，每层的命名视图保存在 "},{"type":"text","text":"surfaceViews","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-443e5fe5"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"展开一个嵌入模块只改变显示位置，操作仍落在"},{"type":"text","text":"同一节点","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"和同一次保存事务上。个人的相机位置、滚动和选择不会进入内容 hash。字段细节见"},{"type":"text","text":"页面文件格式","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/file-format"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"，交互见"},{"type":"text","text":"Page 与 Board","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/page-board"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3d3e54e0"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-3e3e5673"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一次编辑怎样不覆盖别人的修改"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent 和用户可能同时修改同一页。Core 用内容 hash 和资源 revision 识别过期写入，用区块 id 计算差异，这样 Agent 只需读取变化部分。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3f3e5806"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-sequence","version":"1.0.0","props":{"title":"Agent 与用户同时编辑一页","actors":[{"id":"agent","label":"Agent","sub":"CLI / MCP","icon":"🤖","tone":"teal"},{"id":"core","label":"Core","sub":"src/core","icon":"⚙️","tone":"warm"},{"id":"lib","label":"内容库","icon":"🗄️","tone":"slate"},{"id":"user","label":"用户","sub":"工作台","icon":"🧑","tone":"brand"}],"steps":[{"from":"agent","to":"core","label":"读取页面","kind":"call","detail":"`page_read` 或 `pages read`。读取会为这个会话保留一份基线，供以后比较。"},{"from":"core","to":"agent","label":"返回内容与 hash","kind":"reply","detail":"保留 hash、revision 和稳定的区块 id，后续写入都要带上。"},{"from":"user","to":"lib","label":"在工作台中修改并保存","kind":"call","detail":"编辑器串行保存草稿；工作台通过文件变化通知刷新受影响的内容。"},{"from":"agent","to":"core","label":"按旧 hash 请求差异","kind":"call","detail":"`page_diff` / `pages diff --since`。Core 在本地对比基线与当前内容。"},{"from":"core","to":"agent","label":"按区块 id 列出变化","kind":"reply","detail":"新增、删除、移动和字段变化。找不到基线时返回 `MISSING_BASELINE`，需要重新读取整页。"},{"from":"agent","to":"core","label":"用旧 hash 提交修改","kind":"call","detail":"`page_apply` / `page_save`，带 `baseHash` 与 `baseRevision`。"},{"from":"core","to":"agent","label":"CONFLICT + 当前 hash","kind":"reply","detail":"内容已变化时拒绝写入。CLI 以退出码 3 结束。不能只刷新 hash 后用旧文档覆盖。"},{"from":"agent","to":"agent","label":"重读并合并","kind":"note","detail":"重新读取当前页面，对照差异把自己的修改合并进去，而不是用旧文档覆盖。"},{"from":"agent","to":"core","label":"用新 hash 再次提交","kind":"call","detail":"带当前 hash 与 revision 保存成功；用户的修改得以保留。"}]},"integrity":"sha256-54ea7e21b2eb7835fb0ba41ca4d48f1ab21bc27b88b7f8fa2b03d3b910b05e76"},"id":"node-403e5999"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"App 与 CLI 的受控写入使用锁、hash 检查和临时文件替换。绕过它们直接改文件的程序，应保留区块 id 并使用原子替换，否则得不到冲突保证。冲突的处理方式见"},{"type":"text","text":"内容库与版本","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-493e67c4"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-4a3e6957"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件、模板与目录"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"组件和模板按"},{"type":"text","text":"项目、全局、已发布","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"的顺序解析，内置条目兜底。每个版本内容固定，修改就产生新版本；页面里的引用锁定到 "},{"type":"text","text":"id + version + integrity","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"，同名条目不会悄悄替换旧引用。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d345fcc7"}},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"自定义组件在 "},{"type":"text","text":"sandbox=\"allow-scripts\"","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 的 iframe 中运行，不能访问桌面桥接、文件系统或外部网络。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-191dd73c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c09527a3"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"会话宿主禁止嵌套 iframe 时，inline 导出使用单独编译的挂载代码，在宿主沙箱里以 Shadow DOM 隔离样式。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3ee49ca7"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bf952610"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"组合模板在创建页面时展开并锁定组件引用，成品导出不需要携带模板。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6f6c4d86"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c2952ac9"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d245fb34"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"开发与发布流程见"},{"type":"text","text":"开发自定义组件","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://showai.rena